Implemented `--group-by-category` with filtering before grouping, sorted category summaries, and exact decimal totals formatted as two-digit JSON strings.

Ungrouped behavior is preserved. Invalid CSV returns exit code 2 with a useful stderr message and no traceback. Processing remains separate from argument parsing. README includes a grouped example and expected output.

All 10 supplied tests pass; tests were unchanged. Additional malformed CSV and large-total checks passed.
